{
  "id": "PRO.29",
  "number": "29",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 29",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He, that being often reproved hardeneth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neck, shall suddenly be destroyed, and that without remedy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the righteous are in authority, the people rejoice: but when the wicked beareth rule, the people mourn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoso loveth wisdom rejoiceth his father: but he that keepeth company with harlots spendeth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "substance.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king by judgment establisheth the land: but he that receiveth gifts overthroweth it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A man that flattereth his neighbour spreadeth a net for his feet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the transgression of an evil man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a snare: but the righteous doth sing and rejoice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The righteous considereth the cause of the poor:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the wicked regardeth not to know",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Scornful men bring a city into a snare: but wise",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "turn away wrath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "If",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a wise man contendeth with a foolish man, whether he rage or laugh,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no rest.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The bloodthirsty hate the upright: but the just seek his soul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A fool uttereth all his mind: but a wise",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "man",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "keepeth it in till afterwards.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If a ruler hearken to lies, all his servants",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wicked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The poor and the deceitful man meet together: the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lighteneth both their eyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king that faithfully judgeth the poor, his throne shall be established for ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The rod and reproof give wisdom: but a child left",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to himself",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bringeth his mother to shame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the wicked are multiplied, transgression increaseth: but the righteous shall see their fall.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Correct thy son, and he shall give thee rest; yea, he shall give delight unto thy soul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no vision, the people perish: but he that keepeth the law, happy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A servant will not be corrected by words: for though he understand he will not answer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seest thou a man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hasty in his words?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.29.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.29.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "more hope of a fool than of him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that delicately bringeth up his servant from a child shall have him become",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
